flowchart TB
  accTitle: Mail architecture on Vertex
  accDescr: Three HAProxy node frontends preserve client addresses and destination ports for two Stalwart replicas. PostgreSQL holds mail data; Redis Sentinel holds transient state. Collectors and helpers run on Vertex. Logical backups go to B2.
  Clients["SMTP + existing mail clients"] --> Edge["Three node frontends<br/>HAProxy / host ports"]
  Edge -->|PROXY v2| Core["Two Stalwart replicas<br/>Native auth + original listeners"]:::core
  Web["Mail HTTPS"] --> Traefik["Traefik<br/>Exact-SNI passthrough"] --> Core
  Collect["Single-owner collectors<br/>ClamAV + constrained AI"] --> Core
  Core --> DB[("Three PostgreSQL instances<br/>Mail data + blobs + search")]:::store
  Core --> Redis["Three Redis members<br/>Sentinel"]:::store
  DB --> Backup["Daily logical backup<br/>restic → B2 / hash readback"]:::store
  Core --> SES["Amazon SES<br/>Most outbound mail"]
  Core --> Direct["Vertex IPv4<br/>Direct delivery remainder"]

  classDef core fill:#d92650,color:#ffffff,stroke:#b91c45,stroke-width:2px
  classDef store fill:#eff6ff,color:#1e3a5f,stroke:#93b4d5
  classDef good fill:#ecfdf5,color:#14532d,stroke:#86b99e
  classDef warning fill:#fff1f2,color:#9f1239,stroke:#e8a3b4
